  {
   "id": "like-a-dragon-ishin-217597@post-2023-03-09",
   "gameId": "like-a-dragon-ishin-217597",
   "displayName": "Known Issue - Kijin-maru Kunishige Weapon",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2023-03-09T22:15:25.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello RGG Fans!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re aware of an issue with the Kijin-maru Kunishige included in the digital version pre-order bonus Japanese Swords & Cannon Set and are currently investigating the issue and evaluating methods to fix it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Issues caused by Kijin-maru Kunishige",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The following issue will occur when seven seals are set (filling out all slots) on Kijin-maru Kunishige.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "All seals set on Kijin-maru Kunishige will change to the first set seal",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The item placed next to Kijin-maru Kunishige will change to another item",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Depending on the changed item, the game may crash when the Equipment menu is opened",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For customers who have purchased the Kijin-maru Kunishige, we kindly ask the following:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please do not set the seventh seal (i.e. do not fill all the slots) on the Kijin-maru Kunishige until the patch is delivered.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you have already set the seventh seal and the item has changed, please consider the following steps:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Do not change the seal on the Kijin-maru Kunishige, and please wait for the patch to be delivered.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Load a save file created before setting the seventh seal.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you have the Kijin-maru Kunishige, we appreciate your understanding and cooperation.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In addition, the team is currently working on the next patch that includes bug fixes and balance adjustments, which we plan to release soon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
